{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51753","headline":"乘烟观蒋链师（蒋甚伟，非妇人之状。） · 向瓒","name":"乘烟观蒋链师（蒋甚伟，非妇人之状。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怪得盘跚不上昇，白云蹋绽紫云崩。\n龙腰凤背犹嫌软，须问麻姑借大鹏。\n（同前）（〖1〗曹汛谓向瓒爲何瓒之误。\n《全唐诗》卷七六九收何赞，亦应作何瓒。\n事迹见《新五代史》卷二八本传。\n今按：《南唐近事》有陈沆讽庐山道士绝句，与此大同小异。\n陈诗收）（《全唐诗》卷七五七。\n《监诫录》成书早於《南唐近事》，诗以向作爲近是。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"向瓒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51753.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51753","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}